      "statement": "Regular code-fence protection applies to the line-oriented autolink and CTA preprocessors, but not to conditional rendering: _apply_conditional_rendering() performs a whole-document regex substitution with no code-fence state, so conditional-looking markers in a code fence can still be rendered.",
